# Project: Dependencies

Purpose:
  Project-specific dependency state and graph.
  Tracks actual dependency graph, lock state, and
  resource reservations for the current project.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @graph.sdd
   3 @locks.sdd
   4 @reservations/

Rules:
  [PD1] Dependency graph MUST be acyclic.
  [PD2] Lock conflicts MUST be resolved before deployment.
  [PD3] Reservations MUST have expiration.

Navigation:
  Graph: @graph.sdd
  Locks: @locks.sdd
  Reservations: @reservations/
  RootDependencies: @../dependencies/INDEX.sdd

State: +
